    "detailed_description": "The year is 1888. Dr. Cyril Splutterworth, an eccentric inventor, needs brave adventurers to help him explore the Victorian world.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nWill you busy yourself in the laboratory testing strange gadgets, or hop on a steamship to the frontiers of Her Majesty\u2019s Empire?<br />\r\n<br />\r\nVictoriana - Steampunk Text Adventure is a text-based game, echoing the style of classic CYOA stories. <br />\r\n<br />\r\nThe text adventure has several possible outcomes. You may have to depend on your charm and charisma, technical knowhow or pure common sense to win the day.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nA plethora of possibilities await you, and you might even get through it alive!",
